<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Settings and Health check copy (SPEC-UX S5/S6, name addendum §2.6/§3).

  Every claim here is one the app can stand behind: a row whose evidence is missing says
  "Not checked", and the privacy statement is the plan\'s sentence verbatim.

  The name addendum forbids the "lock" family of words outside the HyperOS step in
  strings_onboarding_oem.xml, so the Recents row is titled "Keep Sadiq in Recents" and its hint
  describes the gesture instead of repeating the OS\'s own menu label.
-->
